{"unit_id":"kaixinbaba__dsh-vision-recognizer#card-zh","repo":"kaixinbaba/dsh-vision-recognizer","commit":"167ef3d7fa803854469e7f770ffc52e6bfec5845","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-recognizer 是面向 DSH Web 的识图插件，会注册包装对话模型的提供商路由：原生支持图片的模型直接接收图片，文本模型则调用可配置视觉服务转写。它提供多供应商和 OpenAI 兼容接口、Anthropic 协议、本地 Ollama 探测、失败回退、设置页配置与连接测试，并支持转写缓存。适合希望在 DSH 对话中使用图片、同时保留原对话模型的用户。文本模型转写需要配置供应商密钥或本地 Ollama；图片可能发送给所选视觉端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:284-324","lib/providers.js:22-173","client/client.js:145-225","lib/core.js:270-343"]}
{"unit_id":"kaixinbaba__dsh-vision-recognizer#card-en","repo":"kaixinbaba/dsh-vision-recognizer","commit":"167ef3d7fa803854469e7f770ffc52e6bfec5845","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-recognizer wraps a DSH model route. Vision models receive images directly; text-only models use a vision service to transcribe them. It supports multiple providers, local Ollama, fallbacks, settings and connection testing. Text-only use needs a provider key or local Ollama.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:284-324","lib/providers.js:22-173","client/client.js:145-225","lib/core.js:270-343"]}
